ause no local item means no identity to resolve.","id":"099ed99d3f90d035b815ad36487617d9f575283b9e6e7214f9377107800fa102","intervals":[[48,48]],"path":"src/queue-runner/localReviewAssociate.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Mark an existing PR link stale when no local-review item remains."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"b86ef987f2d8488b743569869353505631c9a26e","body":"**Map `needs-human` live-unit results to exit code 3.**\n\n`liveUnitExitCode` returns 1 for every non-`ok` status. A live unit that returns `needs-human` therefore exits 1 unless its dispatch supplies an explicit `exitCode`. Doctrine I1 assigns exit code 3 to needs-human results and reserves 1 for thrown errors. Add a `needs-human` check before the generic non-`ok` branch.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n function liveUnitExitCode(command: string, result: OpResult<unknown>): number {\n+  if (result.status === 'needs-human') return 3;\n   if (result.status !== 'ok') return 1;\n```\n\n</details>","id":"49c01bdd06cd9c77787b1c5e1cec0b549a69f4a516bffd3230681b8a9e521533","intervals":[[135,135]],"path":"src/queue-runner/runner.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Map `needs-human` live-unit results to exit code 3."}],"head":"422191e2e083255a529500ba41c45b2aee51712c","head_tree":"2a6378f38614c8b16a7d30447cf71e2ddc2985f6","input_scope":[{"blob":"45c5590f90b014c58d4859f43aa550d5907892ca","intervals":[[1,79]],"path":"src/queue-runner/admitAvailable.ts"},{"blob":"0e1cdc7a7c243cfbf6d489b1501c9ef2dd8cf9ed","intervals":[[1,57]],"path":"src/queue-runner/collectFinished.ts"},{"blob":"614e78e45c915e33a60ef7b10501018f79352b46","intervals":[[1,111]],"path":"src/queue-runner/localReviewAssociate.ts"},{"blob":"b86ef987f2d8488b743569869353505631c9a26e","intervals":[[1,252]],"path":"src/queue-runner/runner.ts"},{"blob":"3093b2350dc5e10348aead31655bcdba769d39e2","intervals":[[1,130]],"path":"src/queue-runner/slotDeadlineHeart